    "long_instructions": "*This level follows a video that you may have watched with your class. If you missed the video, you can watch it [here](https://youtu.be/auv10y-dN4s).*\r\n\r\n# Debug: Pink Tags\r\n\r\n\r\nSomeone has submitted a bug report on this web page.  Can you fix the bug?\r\n\r\n![Bug report](https://images.code.org/366cea4f850465f2fe6270ee17356016-image-1767512692434.png)\r\n \r\n# Do this\r\n1) Find and fix the problem that is causing the bug\r\n\r\n",
